*   **Schedule C (Profit or Loss from Business):** To report your $15,000 consulting income and deduct your business expenses (including the $1,350 if applicable).
*   **Schedule SE (Self-Employment Tax):** To calculate the Medicare and Social Security taxes on your net consulting income.
